#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:156
#: 7cdde3c1e6b84f84b05d843f28f99934
msgid "this autopilot uses a high precision current sensor which is sensitive to ESC switching noise. Be sure to use the bypass capacitor provided. In some cases, the ESCs themselves will need additional 200-330uF low ESR capacitors on their power inputs, if they do not incorporate them already. See `Matek FAQs <http://www.mateksys.com/?p=5712#tab-id-12>`__ for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:159
#: 93ed7f8f81b44fe28750042a2572fff7
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:161
#: bef8a8ed27c54930a9adf9f7e96622d8
msgid "Firmware for these boards can be found `here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"MatekH743\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:164
#: 06d8eb6db65045e9b123e6cfb307f721
msgid "Firmware that supports :ref:`bi-directional Dshot <bidir-dshot>` is labeled \"MatekH743-bdshot\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:166
#: 36ede226bf2a45a4b131544647f713f5
msgid "The bi-directional Dshot firmware redefines the Rx6 pin as a pure UART input, and cannot support PPM. It also requires that the :ref:`SERIAL7_PROTOCOL<SERIAL7_PROTOCOL>` = 23 and that :ref:`SERIAL7_OPTIONS<SERIAL7_OPTIONS>` = 3 for use with SBUS to provide inversion. In addition, outputs 9-12 no longer support normal Dshot. Only outputs 1-8 are bi-directional Dshot capable, with 1-2,3-4,5-6,7-8 in groups. Finally, the buzzer in the USB dongle will no longer play musical tones, only simple buzzer beeps."
msgstr ""

